 the player with their own condition and choices as a video game consumer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unusual mix of genres: psychological horror, virtual companion, and <i>pink game</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An experience on the border between nostalgia, horror, and weirdcore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disturbing investigation about control relationships and dark secrets of a mysterious technology company.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personal documents rooted in reality: family photos, archives, and found footage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/b141d587f75a51ee05785e97db1eb2ea.poster.avif?t=1771864031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/extras/b141d587f75a51ee05785e97db1eb2ea.webm?t=1771864031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Le Clown De La Classe"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3948370/170686b9fc815e25b90bbcfc88708220a46fbc16/header.jpg?t=1771864031","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3948370/1166553770/87e89e605178ec1509dbe920dc94e47e95bc9523/1771328089/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771863603","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail